{"id":"14c630355ef04ac5","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-inf-complexity.md","title":"Inf 的 Pi2 完全性","display":"thm-inf-complexity — Inf 的 Pi2 完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-inf-complexity","aliases":["20-thm-inf-complexity"],"display":"thm-inf-complexity — Inf 的 Pi2 完全性","chapter":"4","section":"4.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.3.2","source_pdf_pages":[122],"source_printed_pages":[86],"depends_on":["[[20-df-inf]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-inf-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-inf-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-inf-complexity — Inf 的 Pi2 完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.3.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>122</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>86</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"574494b7c7eef96a\" href=\"?note=574494b7c7eef96a\" title=\"20-df-inf\">20-df-inf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Inf}\\)</span> 采用标准编号。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"574494b7c7eef96a\" href=\"?note=574494b7c7eef96a\" title=\"20-df-inf\">20-df-inf</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inf\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\ne\\in\\mathrm{Inf}\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ \\exists s\\ [|W_{e,s}|&gt;n],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Inf},\\Pi^0_2).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inf\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\ne\\in\\mathrm{Inf}\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ \\exists s\\ [|W_{e,s}|&gt;n],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Inf},\\Pi^0_2).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|W_e|=\\omega\">\\(|W_e|=\\omega\\)</span> 恰当且仅当每个有限基数界都在某个阶段被超过，给显示的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\)</span> 式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的正规形 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall y\\exists z\\ R(x,y,z)\">\\(\\forall y\\exists z\\ R(x,y,z)\\)</span>，编译程序在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 等待全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le u\">\\(y\\le u\\)</span> 的见证后停止，域如 Tot 证明中为整集或有限初段。因此域无限恰当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\">\\(x\\in P\\)</span>。s-m-n 和 padding 统一给普通总单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\\iff f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Inf}\">\\(x\\in P\\iff f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Inf}\\)</span>；不只给一组分别选取的存在指标。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.3.2；印刷 86 / PDF 122。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-inf","status":"resolved","id":"574494b7c7eef96a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-inf]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-in